00F1                  (            os9.d):01312         E$Sect              RMB       1                   Bad Sector number
00F2                  (            os9.d):01313         E$WP                RMB       1                   Write Protect
00F3                  (            os9.d):01314         E$CRC               RMB       1                   Bad Check Sum
